    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT IS YOUR BEST ALLY :</strong></h2>Strive to survive increasingly tough nights against enemies ever more determined to drag you into darkness. Your flashlight will be your most precious tool. Be sure not to let its battery run out as your life depends on it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE OR HUNT :</strong></h2>Cooperation is the key to survive and the game will encourage players to help each other. However, it will be possible to follow a PVP path, not only as a monster but also as a human. This approach comes with significant drawbacks, including solitude and various &quot;penalties,&quot; making it a particularly challenging endeavor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VICIOUS MONSTERS:</strong></h2>You won't be facing hordes of mindless zombies but rather extremely aggressive monsters capable of cooperating to catch you off guard. Be sure to watch your back to avoid being ambushed by a silently approaching monster.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT IS YOUR BEST ALLY :</strong></h2>Strive to survive increasingly tough nights against enemies ever more determined to drag you into darkness. Your flashlight will be your most precious tool. Be sure not to let its battery run out as your life depends on it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE OR HUNT :</strong></h2>Cooperation is the key to survive and the game will encourage players to help each other. However, it will be possible to follow a PVP path, not only as a monster but also as a human. This approach comes with significant drawbacks, including solitude and various &quot;penalties,&quot; making it a particularly challenging endeavor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VICIOUS MONSTERS:</strong></h2>You won't be facing hordes of mindless zombies but rather extremely aggressive monsters capable of cooperating to catch you off guard. Be sure to watch your back to avoid being ambushed by a silently approaching monster.",
    "short_description": "A photorealistic multiplayer horror game where you have to survive increasingly difficult nights. Unless you'd rather be the nightmare of other players ?",
